WEBVTT

00:00:16.910 --> 00:00:23.050
Before I knew it, I abandoned happiness to survive

00:00:23.720 --> 00:00:30.190
Lying to myself, I danced clinging on to illusions

00:00:30.970 --> 00:00:36.850
At the edge of my vision when I close my eyes

00:00:37.270 --> 00:00:42.840
I was searching for your smile

00:00:43.740 --> 00:00:50.210
With our memories fading

00:00:50.750 --> 00:00:57.290
We hold on to our dreams and run  Yeah

00:00:57.620 --> 00:01:04.190
These feelings that I shut away in my heart

00:01:04.730 --> 00:01:11.420
I'll now grasp them again

00:01:32.000 --> 00:01:36.180
Valon, it's finally time for our showdown.

00:01:36.860 --> 00:01:42.760
Your special cards are Armor Monsters that you wear.

00:01:43.200 --> 00:01:45.560
You think winning is everything?

00:01:45.560 --> 00:01:51.090
Dueling isn't about pummeling your opponent!

00:01:51.090 --> 00:01:55.140
I refuse to lose against you!

00:01:55.970 --> 00:02:01.970
Full Armor Gravitation

00:02:08.920 --> 00:02:11.080
I'll defeat 'em all!

00:02:11.080 --> 00:02:12.770
That's impossible, Honda!

00:02:14.680 --> 00:02:16.080
Yugi!

00:02:17.280 --> 00:02:18.860
Big brother!

00:02:19.560 --> 00:02:22.920
I have no time to waste on weaklings.

00:02:22.920 --> 00:02:24.790
I'll end them all at once!

00:02:29.640 --> 00:02:31.290
Timaeus!

00:02:34.340 --> 00:02:36.370
Come, Timaeus!

00:02:41.540 --> 00:02:43.740
Appear, Critias!

00:03:03.760 --> 00:03:04.740
Here I go!

00:03:04.740 --> 00:03:06.670
It's my turn!  I draw!

00:03:07.460 --> 00:03:11.130
I summon Marauding Captain in attack position!

00:03:14.390 --> 00:03:21.980
When it's summoned, I can Special Summon a Level 4 or lower monster from my hand!

00:03:22.200 --> 00:03:25.980
I summon Battle Warrior in attack position!

00:03:28.200 --> 00:03:30.850
You have no monsters on your field!

00:03:30.850 --> 00:03:34.790
Go, Marauding Captain!  Attack Valon directly!

00:03:39.200 --> 00:03:42.790
Then Battle Warrior attacks!

00:03:48.580 --> 00:03:50.010
How's that!

00:03:50.500 --> 00:03:53.160
Those attacks were nothing special.

00:03:53.160 --> 00:03:53.880
What?

00:03:54.100 --> 00:03:56.880
Don't disappoint me, Jonouchi.

00:03:56.880 --> 00:04:00.820
If you want to beat me, attack with all your strength!

00:04:01.070 --> 00:04:04.760
Those lame attacks can't defeat me.

00:04:05.320 --> 00:04:08.230
What's he thinking?

00:04:08.230 --> 00:04:12.710
He's in a bad situation, so why is he so confident?

00:04:13.150 --> 00:04:14.330
I end my turn!

00:04:14.540 --> 00:04:16.700
My turn!  I draw!

00:04:22.490 --> 00:04:25.640
What?  That Armor Monster is already gone!

00:04:25.880 --> 00:04:28.650
When Psychic Armor Head is in my graveyard...

00:04:28.650 --> 00:04:33.580
...I can Special Summon it during my Standby Phase in attack position.

00:04:33.860 --> 00:04:40.900
I told you I've only begun summoning my invincible Armor Monsters.

00:04:40.900 --> 00:04:42.000
What?  Not again!

00:04:42.000 --> 00:04:45.420
I know you're scared, but you have nowhere to hide!

00:04:45.420 --> 00:04:50.380
From my hand, I activate the spell card, The Seal of Orichalcos!

00:05:00.940 --> 00:05:01.980
That's...

00:05:05.900 --> 00:05:07.180
Found you!

00:05:38.210 --> 00:05:41.210
Only the winner can leave this Seal!

00:05:43.650 --> 00:05:47.590
I activate my spell card, Full Armor Gravitation!

00:05:48.130 --> 00:05:55.130
I draw ten cards from my deck, and I Special Summon all the Armor Monsters among them!

00:05:55.450 --> 00:05:56.720
Ten cards?

00:05:59.450 --> 00:06:01.410
Burning Knuckle!

00:06:04.110 --> 00:06:06.050
Jet Gauntlet!

00:06:07.630 --> 00:06:09.420
Over Boost!

00:06:09.750 --> 00:06:11.650
Active Guard!

00:06:11.650 --> 00:06:13.070
Buster Knuckle!

00:06:13.600 --> 00:06:16.690
And Advanced Shield in attack position!

00:06:25.660 --> 00:06:29.730
He summoned seven monsters instantly!

00:06:30.100 --> 00:06:32.520
Full Armor Gravitation!

00:06:50.330 --> 00:06:51.920
They combined again!

00:06:51.920 --> 00:06:54.420
This is my invincible Armor Deck!

00:06:54.420 --> 00:06:57.860
I win by pummeling my enemy with power!

00:06:58.100 --> 00:07:01.230
The opponent has 2500 life points.

00:07:01.230 --> 00:07:04.970
Opponent's monsters:  Marauding Captain has 1200 attack points.

00:07:04.970 --> 00:07:08.300
Battle Warrior has 700 attack points.

00:07:08.840 --> 00:07:14.840
He summoned a lot of Armor, but his attack points only rose from 0 to 700.

00:07:14.840 --> 00:07:17.750
Is he going to use some sort of effect?

00:07:18.000 --> 00:07:20.120
Here I go, Jonouchi!

00:07:20.120 --> 00:07:22.580
Target confirmed.  Locking on.

00:07:22.580 --> 00:07:26.220
Marauding Captain's destruction probability: 99%.

00:07:26.220 --> 00:07:29.630
Buster Knuckle - begin charging energy.

00:07:33.570 --> 00:07:35.500
What?  His attack points!

00:07:35.500 --> 00:07:42.850
For every Armor Monster on the field, Buster Knuckle gains 200 attack points!

00:07:52.180 --> 00:07:55.420
What did you just do?

00:07:55.890 --> 00:07:57.820
How's that, Jonouchi?

00:07:57.820 --> 00:07:59.860
This is how to attack.

00:08:00.110 --> 00:08:04.170
Since my Armor Monsters gained the power of the Orichalcos...

00:08:04.170 --> 00:08:09.030
...they not only damage your life points.  They damage your body as well!

00:08:09.380 --> 00:08:10.470
What?

00:08:10.980 --> 00:08:14.110
My fight is more than a duel.

00:08:14.110 --> 00:08:15.740
It's a real fight.

00:08:15.740 --> 00:08:21.620
Got it?  Each attack will hack your organs, sapping your energy!

00:08:22.330 --> 00:08:26.650
Only one Armor Monster can attack per turn.

00:08:26.650 --> 00:08:29.250
You lucked out, Jonouchi.

00:08:29.250 --> 00:08:31.420
I end my turn.

00:08:34.300 --> 00:08:37.820
What's wrong?  It's your turn.

00:08:37.820 --> 00:08:41.300
Or can you no longer stand?

00:08:41.700 --> 00:08:43.820
That did hurt.

00:08:44.520 --> 00:08:48.240
But that's not enough to make me quit!

00:08:49.140 --> 00:08:52.400
You're so dumb you don't know the difference in our strengths.

00:08:52.400 --> 00:08:57.250
Be quiet!  You don't know that until this match is over!

00:08:57.250 --> 00:08:59.840
If I think I'll lose, then I will lose.

00:08:59.840 --> 00:09:03.960
That's why I always believe in my power!

00:09:04.640 --> 00:09:08.300
Even if I lose, I'll stand up and challenge you again!

00:09:08.300 --> 00:09:10.760
That means I'll win someday!

00:09:11.740 --> 00:09:17.120
I get it now.  Mai couldn't stand that nonsense.

00:09:17.500 --> 00:09:20.170
What?  What does Mai have to do with this?

00:09:20.170 --> 00:09:22.420
Mai isn't like you.

00:09:22.420 --> 00:09:25.420
Mai is similar to me.

00:09:25.940 --> 00:09:28.940
Don't you want to win, Mai Kujaku?

00:09:40.800 --> 00:09:45.290
You've now joined Doma.

00:09:50.460 --> 00:09:54.170
Mai, how does it feel to have power?

00:09:54.440 --> 00:09:58.040
Thanks for bringing me to Dartz.

00:09:58.040 --> 00:10:01.110
But I don't owe you anything.

00:10:02.680 --> 00:10:04.600
I'll never lose again.

00:10:04.600 --> 00:10:07.550
Friendship gets in the way of winning.

00:10:07.760 --> 00:10:14.990
I'll defeat anyone who stands in my way, even if it's you or Dartz.

00:10:15.800 --> 00:10:17.340
I like that.

00:10:17.340 --> 00:10:19.930
You and I are similar.

00:10:21.200 --> 00:10:22.600
I'm the same.

00:10:22.600 --> 00:10:26.630
Winning is all that matters to me.

00:10:33.700 --> 00:10:34.880
What's wrong?

00:10:34.880 --> 00:10:37.820
You defeated Pegasus, but you don't look happy.

00:10:37.820 --> 00:10:41.880
He's not tough to defeat for me anymore.

00:10:43.620 --> 00:10:47.370
This isn't the kind of duel I'm looking for.

00:10:47.370 --> 00:10:49.170
The ones I want to duel are...

00:10:49.780 --> 00:10:54.180
Hunger for victory and fear of loss.

00:10:54.180 --> 00:10:56.200
Do you know how that feels?

00:10:56.880 --> 00:10:59.130
Of course you don't!

00:10:59.620 --> 00:11:04.040
You're not the one who understands Mai and can walk by her side!

00:11:04.040 --> 00:11:05.600
It's me!

00:11:06.200 --> 00:11:12.010
I may not have understood her.  But...

00:11:12.430 --> 00:11:14.300
Stand up, Jonouchi!

00:11:15.460 --> 00:11:18.920
Save your tears of frustration after you lose a duel!

00:11:19.970 --> 00:11:21.860
It's a runny nose, not tears!

00:11:23.180 --> 00:11:24.860
It's not stopping.

00:11:24.860 --> 00:11:25.680
Here.

00:11:26.440 --> 00:11:29.030
Wipe your nose.  You look pathetic.

00:11:29.910 --> 00:11:33.130
Jonouchi, don't abandon your wishes so quickly.

00:11:37.620 --> 00:11:38.740
This is...

00:11:39.530 --> 00:11:46.600
The real her won't sacrifice others to win.

00:11:46.600 --> 00:11:51.880
Since you're trying to destroy the world, she shouldn't join you!

00:11:52.450 --> 00:11:53.290
So?

00:11:53.520 --> 00:11:55.680
I'm going to take Mai back!

00:11:55.680 --> 00:11:58.480
I won't give up until that happens!

00:11:58.480 --> 00:12:00.570
It's my turn!  I draw!

00:12:14.910 --> 00:12:16.880
It's my turn!  I draw!

00:12:18.910 --> 00:12:24.550
I tribute Battle Warrior to summon Jinzo!

00:12:26.470 --> 00:12:31.330
Opponent's monster: Jinzo has 2400 attack points.

00:12:31.330 --> 00:12:33.590
Ability: Trap Search.

00:12:33.800 --> 00:12:35.850
Go, Jinzo!

00:12:35.850 --> 00:12:38.570
Attack Psychic Armor Head!

00:12:40.280 --> 00:12:43.000
Altering target.

00:12:47.020 --> 00:12:47.980
What?

00:12:55.160 --> 00:13:01.860
When Armor Monsters are attacked, I can choose which Armor gets attacked.

00:13:03.070 --> 00:13:06.290
But your other Armor can't destroy Jinzo!

00:13:06.720 --> 00:13:08.230
Are you sure?

00:13:08.870 --> 00:13:11.170
Why is he so confident?

00:13:11.480 --> 00:13:14.170
Does he still have something up his sleeve?

00:13:20.820 --> 00:13:22.080
Help!

00:13:24.730 --> 00:13:26.080
Anzu!  Rebecca!

00:13:27.160 --> 00:13:28.120
Yugi!

00:13:30.490 --> 00:13:32.880
Are you okay, Anzu and Rebecca?

00:13:32.880 --> 00:13:33.520
Yugi!

00:13:42.350 --> 00:13:43.930
You did it, big brother!

00:13:52.380 --> 00:13:53.810
Everyone okay?

00:13:54.020 --> 00:13:55.670
Yeah.  Barely.

00:13:55.670 --> 00:13:57.790
This is a nightmare!

00:13:57.790 --> 00:14:00.310
I can't believe they're around!

00:14:01.020 --> 00:14:02.350
Wait, big brother!

00:14:02.820 --> 00:14:03.750
Kaiba!

00:14:03.980 --> 00:14:07.190
We can't waste time here.

00:14:07.400 --> 00:14:12.630
I'm going to Paradius headquarters and end their farce!

00:14:15.700 --> 00:14:18.060
Yugi, what will you do?

00:14:19.140 --> 00:14:22.500
I'll join you after I find Jonouchi.

00:14:23.560 --> 00:14:25.030
Suit yourself.

00:14:25.710 --> 00:14:30.780
Kaiba Corporation was taken over, but its satellite system should still be working.

00:14:31.730 --> 00:14:32.900
That's right!

00:14:32.900 --> 00:14:38.080
We can find Jonouchi by hacking the satellite system and accessing his Duel Disk!

00:14:40.000 --> 00:14:41.020
Kaiba.

00:14:41.240 --> 00:14:43.060
I don't need your help.

00:14:43.060 --> 00:14:44.960
I'll defeat Dartz.

00:14:45.420 --> 00:14:48.530
Hey!  It's not safe to go by yourselves!

00:14:48.530 --> 00:14:50.630
Oh well.  They're gone.

00:15:13.180 --> 00:15:16.690
Will it be easy to hack?

00:15:16.920 --> 00:15:18.760
Becky can handle it.

00:15:18.760 --> 00:15:21.160
She's a genius.

00:15:27.920 --> 00:15:29.840
It's my turn!  I draw!

00:15:33.720 --> 00:15:35.410
Locking on target.

00:15:41.680 --> 00:15:44.140
He gained attack points again!

00:15:44.350 --> 00:15:45.310
Can it be?

00:15:45.540 --> 00:15:52.320
Yes.  Burning Knuckle also gains 200 attack points for every Armor Monster on the field.

00:15:52.320 --> 00:15:54.970
But it's still less than Jinzo's!

00:15:55.660 --> 00:15:58.770
I attack!  Burning Knuckle!

00:15:59.560 --> 00:16:00.670
No way!

00:16:00.670 --> 00:16:04.000
I told you I always duel at full strength!

00:16:04.000 --> 00:16:06.770
I'll crush you head-on!

00:16:17.800 --> 00:16:21.190
See?  You're the one who lost.

00:16:22.200 --> 00:16:23.660
What's so funny?

00:16:23.880 --> 00:16:25.600
Look closer.

00:16:30.380 --> 00:16:33.000
It's down to 700 attack points?

00:16:33.490 --> 00:16:39.940
When a monster battles Burning Knuckle, it loses attack points equal to Burning Knuckle's.

00:16:39.940 --> 00:16:46.450
Damn!  He was willing to lose life points to lower Jinzo's attack points.

00:16:46.870 --> 00:16:48.950
He's crazy.

00:16:49.520 --> 00:16:54.000
But he's still confident, attacking without hesitation.

00:16:54.000 --> 00:16:55.980
He's tough.

00:16:56.200 --> 00:16:58.570
But I can't afford to lose!

00:16:59.360 --> 00:17:01.560
Here I go!  It's my turn!  I draw!

00:17:02.090 --> 00:17:04.960
I summon Rocket Warrior in attack position!

00:17:07.710 --> 00:17:11.480
Rocket Warrior attacks Over Boost!

00:17:11.480 --> 00:17:12.870
Invincible Mode!

00:17:13.390 --> 00:17:16.140
Altering target.

00:17:16.770 --> 00:17:18.310
Bring it on!

00:17:22.770 --> 00:17:24.090
So that's your move.

00:17:24.090 --> 00:17:29.120
They both have 1500 attack points, but Rocket Warrior's effect zeroes the damage.

00:17:29.650 --> 00:17:34.660
And Jinzo has fewer attack points, but it can still attack!

00:17:35.280 --> 00:17:36.910
Jet Gauntlet!

00:17:51.000 --> 00:17:53.220
Jinzo...

00:17:54.080 --> 00:17:57.120
Is this also an Armor Monster's effect?

00:17:58.120 --> 00:18:05.060
Yes.  When Jet Gauntlet is destroyed, your monster in attack position is destroyed.

00:18:05.280 --> 00:18:06.830
Not bad.

00:18:07.370 --> 00:18:08.490
Same with you.

00:18:12.350 --> 00:18:16.770
The Seal of Orichalcos activated around here.

00:18:17.320 --> 00:18:19.470
Where are they?

00:18:19.470 --> 00:18:21.660
I'm the one who'll defeat Jonouchi.

00:18:21.660 --> 00:18:23.810
Or else, I...

00:18:28.760 --> 00:18:35.540
Those who lose a Shadow Game has their souls devoured by the darkness.

00:18:35.540 --> 00:18:38.200
Slowly.

00:18:39.250 --> 00:18:42.160
No...  No!

00:18:43.130 --> 00:18:44.840
Let me out!

00:18:44.840 --> 00:18:47.130
Let me out of here!  Help me!

00:18:47.440 --> 00:18:52.070
I never want to return to that dark place again!

00:18:57.530 --> 00:19:02.300
I'll defeat whoever stands in my way.

00:19:02.300 --> 00:19:07.490
Jonouchi, Yugi...  Even you, Valon, if you get in my way!

00:19:15.440 --> 00:19:18.560
Hey!  Still haven't found Jonouchi?

00:19:19.000 --> 00:19:22.230
Calm down.  Rebecca won't be able to focus.

00:19:22.230 --> 00:19:25.240
Yeah.  Let's trust her and wait.

00:19:25.240 --> 00:19:31.410
But Jonouchi may already be dueling Valon!

00:19:31.930 --> 00:19:33.260
Yeah, but...

00:19:34.420 --> 00:19:37.420
Why couldn't I stop him?

00:19:37.420 --> 00:19:38.480
Honda...

00:19:38.640 --> 00:19:44.190
Jonouchi feels responsible for Mai's condition.

00:19:48.440 --> 00:19:50.160
It's my fault.

00:19:50.160 --> 00:19:51.100
Jonouchi?

00:19:51.310 --> 00:19:56.030
I noticed nothing until she turned into that.

00:19:56.440 --> 00:19:57.720
Nothing.

00:19:57.720 --> 00:19:58.970
Jonouchi...

00:19:59.720 --> 00:20:03.260
So I'll settle things with her.

00:20:03.260 --> 00:20:05.410
I'll save her this time.

00:20:05.930 --> 00:20:08.850
Honda, don't tell Yugi what I said!

00:20:11.320 --> 00:20:13.920
Jonouchi...

00:20:14.380 --> 00:20:19.020
He's not responsible!  But Mai is...

00:20:19.460 --> 00:20:21.960
Jonouchi said that?

00:20:24.140 --> 00:20:25.580
Jonouchi...

00:20:26.120 --> 00:20:27.970
Don't take it too far.

00:20:30.350 --> 00:20:31.800
It's my turn!  I draw!

00:20:32.360 --> 00:20:35.640
I summon Buster Pyle in attack position!

00:20:35.900 --> 00:20:37.810
Another Armor Monster?

00:20:38.020 --> 00:20:42.750
Yes.  And Buster Pyle also has an effect!

00:20:43.380 --> 00:20:46.680
Locking on target: Rocket Warrior.

00:20:46.680 --> 00:20:49.740
Take this!  Pyle Shoot!

00:20:54.280 --> 00:21:00.020
Buster Pyle has 500 attack points, but it destroyed Rocket Warrior with 1500 attack points?

00:21:00.020 --> 00:21:02.500
It's Buster Pyle's effect!

00:21:02.510 --> 00:21:07.510
It takes 0 battle damage, and it destroys your monster!

00:21:07.720 --> 00:21:11.220
And it deals you 500 points of damage!

00:21:12.400 --> 00:21:16.240
I activate a spell card from my hand!

00:21:16.240 --> 00:21:17.320
Data Brain!

00:21:20.230 --> 00:21:23.020
I attach it to Psychic Armor Head!

00:21:24.640 --> 00:21:26.970
I end my turn.

00:21:27.180 --> 00:21:32.080
What effect does that Equip Spell have?

00:21:32.080 --> 00:21:35.350
No!  I can't afford to be scared!

00:21:35.970 --> 00:21:38.910
It's my turn!  I draw!

00:21:39.470 --> 00:21:41.340
Yes!  I drew it!

00:21:41.560 --> 00:21:44.220
I'll bet on this card!

00:21:58.970 --> 00:22:07.880
The streets flow by, colored in red

00:22:08.380 --> 00:22:16.290
If you notice your pain, it changes to joy

00:22:17.950 --> 00:22:27.380
People learn of friendship every time they wipe their tears

00:22:27.990 --> 00:22:36.900
With the warm strength you gave me, I'll change them into kindness

00:22:37.470 --> 00:22:45.930
My overflowing emotions don't stop

00:22:46.710 --> 00:22:51.440
I'll live feeling them

00:22:52.050 --> 00:22:56.620
For me to be me

00:22:56.620 --> 00:23:05.080
Overflowing friendship heals me

00:23:05.760 --> 00:23:10.720
Our chance meeting was real

00:23:11.240 --> 00:23:20.450
We'll both understand that someday

00:23:27.980 --> 00:23:30.980
Jonouchi and Valon clash with all their might.

00:23:30.980 --> 00:23:34.540
Their duel is getting more intense.

00:23:34.540 --> 00:23:38.340
Jonouchi draws Claw of Hermos and punishes Valon.

00:23:38.340 --> 00:23:40.790
But Valon hasn't lost.

00:23:40.790 --> 00:23:48.450
As their back-and-forth pushes them to their limits, something draws them together.

00:23:48.450 --> 00:23:50.840
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh!:
Resonating Souls

00:23:50.840 --> 00:23:52.400
Duel, standby!
